<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico injects 3.412 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico injects 3.412 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico injected 3.412 billion pesos in the secondary market on Monday through three credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.206 bln   9 days   25.59 pct</p>
<p>    1.206 bln   3 days   24.90 pct</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day    24.78 pct</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
